1
00:00:06,367 --> 00:00:09,077
<i>I can hear the sound of the light's heart.</i>

2
00:00:10,077 --> 00:00:12,077
<i>It says it's heading home.</i>

3
00:00:13,707 --> 00:00:16,747
<i>It's similar to my journey's goal.</i>

4
00:00:25,507 --> 00:00:26,797
<i>Mosk...</i>

5
00:00:26,797 --> 00:00:29,097
<i>Is there something there that I want?</i>

6
00:00:29,387 --> 00:00:32,477
<i>And what is that "something"?</i>

7
00:00:48,197 --> 00:00:50,537
<i>Now that even the food has run out,</i>

8
00:00:51,077 --> 00:00:52,827
<i>all that awaits me</i>

9
00:00:56,207 --> 00:00:58,247
<i>is a solitary death.</i>

10
00:00:59,877 --> 00:01:01,547
<i>Alone...</i>

11
00:01:02,957 --> 00:01:03,917
<i>just...</i>

12
00:01:04,667 --> 00:01:06,007
Vince!

13
00:01:09,217 --> 00:01:11,097
Something's blinking!

14
00:01:11,097 --> 00:01:12,307
Over that way!

15
00:01:14,177 --> 00:01:17,307
They might be card soldiers, you know?

16
00:01:20,017 --> 00:01:21,767
You're talking about the picture book, aren't you?

17
00:01:29,117 --> 00:01:30,907
<i>I'm not alone, after all.</i>

18
00:01:31,407 --> 00:01:32,827
<i>I have company...</i>

19
00:01:34,577 --> 00:01:36,577
<i>though she's an infected autoreiv.</i>

20
00:01:38,917 --> 00:01:39,957
Light!

